# Neyma Product Driver — local environment.
#
# Copy to .env only if you need it. The driver works with NO .env at all:
# by default it uses your existing authenticated Claude Code subscription.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# DO NOT SET THIS unless you deliberately want API-key billing.
#
# If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is present, API-key billing TAKES PRECEDENCE over your
# Claude Code subscription. The driver detects this, warns, and refuses to
# continue without explicit confirmation.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Disable coloured terminal output.
# NO_COLOR=1
